examples:
获取当前时间并输出时分秒：
```text
system_clock::time_point tpoint{system_clock::now()};
time_t tt{system_clock::to_time_t(tpoint)};
tm* t{localtime(&tt)};
cout << put_time(t, "%H:%M:%S") << endl;
```

使用stringstream把时间转换为字符串：
```text
stringstream ss;
ss << put_time(t, "%H:%M:%S");
string stringTime{ss.str()};
```

使用strftime()格式化时间：
```text
char buffer[80]{0};
strftime(buffer, sizeof(buffer), "%H:%M:%S", t);
cout << buffer << endl;
```
